    <item>
      <title>2.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:05:40 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2.3.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>### Fixed

- CPU and GPU temperature no longer sticks at ~105 °C on an idle, cool Mac.
  The SMC stores per-cluster throttle limits as keys that read like
  temperatures (~93–105 °C), and the filter that tells them from real
  measurements trusted a key forever after its first change — once such a
  stored limit shifted, it drove the maximum permanently. A key now has to
  keep moving to count toward the maximum; one that holds a single value
  across the observation window is excluded again, and an unmoved key is
  presumed a limit right after launch instead of showing up for the first
  ~13 seconds.
- The Temperature tab no longer disappears for good after a single failed
  sensor read: availability follows the latest read instead of latching off.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/rpegorov/Echo/releases/download/v2.3.1/Echo-2.3.1.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" length="4929548" sparkle:edSignature="e3b4GSdCrrzxTSwhjruQX7fes0xKDyFu6xHyiKjweRP7Xh7hRtv48eQwC6FNNRIfrMFyOtShK712Yul3xGNKCQ==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>2.3</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:13:26 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2.3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>### Added

- Support for macOS 15 (Sequoia) and newer. Echo no longer requires macOS 26.
- Support for Intel Macs: the app is now a universal build for both Apple
  Silicon and Intel.

### Changed

- The clipboard history panel uses a blurred material background on macOS 15
  to 25 and keeps Liquid Glass on macOS 26.

### Known limitations

- CPU and GPU temperature on Intel Macs has not been tested on real hardware;
  the Temperature tab stays hidden if the sensors cannot be read.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/rpegorov/Echo/releases/download/v2.3/Echo-2.3.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" length="4928040" sparkle:edSignature="BlQfdDJR66nc1Gnq1C2kC0Hp0z6lTebQbBtn6B+Yg7Riz3VZfq9joDQ9foBZOpfChEHT8JZxko7dn+FwmuSQDg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>2.2</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:31:03 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>### Added

- Zone highlight while dragging a window: an animated frame with the zone
  name and its keyboard shortcut.
- Thirds and two-thirds of the screen, moving a window to the adjacent
  display, pressing the half hotkey again cycles the width: ½ → ⅔ → ⅓.
- Zone map in settings and zone badges in the shortcuts list.
- Zone grids: templates and custom grids in the editor (split by click,
  merge, drag borders), one grid per display.
- Grid mode: dragging a window with ⌥ held shows all grid zones; with ⌃ the
  window stretches across several zones.
- Zone hotkeys ⌃⌥1…9 and the "Next grid" command.
- Window arrangements: "Remember current", editing in the editor, applying
  from settings, the menu bar or a hotkey; applications that are not running
  are skipped.
- Auto rules: a new window of a chosen application lands in its zone by
  itself.
- Temperature tab in the metrics popover: CPU and GPU temperature charts with
  current and peak readings, sampled from the SMC every second. The popover
  also shows a temperature row next to the network one, and the tab hides
  itself on Macs without readable sensors.

### Changed

- New default shortcuts: ⌃⌥⌘D/F/G/E/T (thirds and two-thirds), ⌃⌥⌘←/→
  (adjacent display), ⌃⌥1…9 (zones). Shortcuts you have already assigned do
  not change. ⌃⌥ and ⌃⌥⌘ overlap with VoiceOver commands — if you use
  VoiceOver, reassign the shortcuts in settings.
- If the system macOS tiling is enabled (including "Hold ⌥ while dragging
  windows"), settings offer to turn it off.

### Fixed

- Mouse window dragging shows the snap zone highlight again: the "the window
  is really being dragged" probe gave up after three reads taken within
  ~11 ms, while the system starts moving the window only after ~0.23 s, so
  the highlight never appeared — neither at screen edges nor in ⌥ grid
  mode.

### Data

- Grids and arrangements are stored in `~/Library/Application Support/
  rostislav.egorov.Echo/window-zones.json`. A corrupted file is set aside as
  `window-zones.corrupt-&lt;date&gt;.json`, and Echo starts with templates.
- Arrangements store window titles — locally, in this file only. Deleting an
  arrangement erases them; the set-aside copies keep them until removed
  manually.
- Echo versions before 2.2 do not see grids and arrangements saved in 2.2:
  after a downgrade only templates are available; the file is not modified.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/rpegorov/Echo/releases/download/v2.2/Echo-2.2.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" length="4923585" sparkle:edSignature="SY2Tl0YGH2ck22vdBj6Wt6XmVl6occk6VG7CXFSjt1NVbkVOGab5b3VmWDwXGytmhshwhIsirDOelEzuI6qOCg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>2.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 20:32:32 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2.1.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>### Исправлено

- Хоткей отмены конвертации слова (⌥⇧Space по умолчанию) снова работает при
  включённом автоисправлении — раньше вместо отмены в текст вставлялся
  неразрывный пробел.
- Удержание хоткея конвертации больше не переворачивает слово туда-обратно:
  автоповтор зажатой клавиши игнорируется, одно нажатие — один переворот.
- Конвертация по хоткею срабатывает мгновенно при нажатии, не дожидаясь
  отпускания клавиш.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/rpegorov/Echo/releases/download/v2.1.1/Echo-2.1.1.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" length="3856776" sparkle:edSignature="kS13LQEZ9OqA3S35zirWBNzphv0dnEsS7nGGC5UdfBU1NC+qlKaUDYgTYHeynDhiejZGFRVMAuZVXUKyyCUYBQ==" />
    </item>
